=== entry 65fdb23aac29
kind: translation
rules: paths, invoke
intent: The verification skill to maintain usually lives in `.agents/skills/verify-*/`. Preserve the several/none handling. With no candidate, the user is told what to type, in both forms.
--- upstream
0. **Locate the target.** Find the verification skill to maintain: the project-local skill whose body has launch/drive sections and a feature map (usually `.cursor/skills/verify-*/`). Several candidates → ask which one; none → stop and point at `/create-verification-skill` instead of inventing a target.
--- patched
0. **Locate the target.** Find the verification skill to maintain: the project-local skill whose body has launch/drive sections and a feature map (usually `.agents/skills/verify-*/`). Several candidates → ask which one; none → stop and point the user at `/create-verification-skill` (`$create-verification-skill` in Codex) instead of inventing a target.

=== entry 9cdc9746c71c
