=== entry a93bd987b6d9
kind: translation
rules: invoke
intent: Names the generating skill as the create-verification-skill skill, with no slash. Everything else stays verbatim.
--- upstream
A feature map rots the moment the app changes. This skill is the upkeep loop for a skill generated by `/create-verification-skill` (or any project-local verification skill with a feature map). The unit of rigor is the feature, not every sentence: cover every feature file from source and exercise every feature live, without terminalising every bullet.
--- patched
A feature map rots the moment the app changes. This skill is the upkeep loop for a skill generated by the **create-verification-skill** skill (or any project-local verification skill with a feature map). The unit of rigor is the feature, not every sentence: cover every feature file from source and exercise every feature live, without terminalising every bullet.
